From ab1bfe4f2ebdd509f89b7ebe32af60b23283e7db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: r1metal <r1metal@localhost>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 10:50:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] input: hynitron: LF line ends in the two files the next patch
 changes

git am strips the CR from patch lines, so a text patch never applies to
a CRLF file. hynitron_config.h and hynitron_tool_debug.c, which the next
patch changes, get LF line ends and nothing else. The patch is binary
for the same reason.
---
 .../touchscreen/CST8xx/hynitron_config.h      | Bin 2244 -> 2146 bytes
 .../touchscreen/CST8xx/hynitron_tool_debug.c  | Bin 55853 -> 53723 bytes
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

